{required_start}Files Loona always loads ({required_count}){required_summary_end}

Your dashboards or shared styling need these files, or Loona can't tell whether they're used.

{required}

Card types with no matching file ({unresolved_count}): {unresolved}

Saved files that no longer exist ({stale_count}): {stale}

When Skip unused card files is on, Loona leaves out files that no dashboard uses. Files it can't identify are always loaded, and everything loads if your dashboards use templates or a scan is incomplete.

Tick extra files you need for pop-ups or other features, and untick saved files you no longer want. Save, then reload your browser. Files that are already loaded stay loaded until you reload. If Skip unused card files isn't working, check the diagnostics.
